### 1. Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test@test.com",
    "password": "1234"
}


### 2. Intentar crear usuario SIN token
POST {{baseUrl}}/usr
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Pedro",
    "email": "pedro@example.com",
    "password": "12345678"
}


### 3. Crear usuario CON token
#POST {{baseUrl}}/usr
POST http://localhost:8000/api/usr
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Pablo",
    "email": "pablot@example.com",
    "password": "12345678"
}

### 4. Listar todos los usuarios
GET http://localhost:8000/api/usr
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 4. Listar todos los usuarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/test-protected
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
